  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to brown.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the ground coriander and ground cumin and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the eggplant, zucchini, and red bell pepper, and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, salt, and black pepper, and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired."
